    "detailed_description": "Open world + Tetris =?<br>Read this, you will find the answer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More than Tetris</h2>In Wall Breaking world, Every room is different Tetris puzzle, you need use your wisdom to break the wall! And find the way out the black.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/994578a40358a7cd427959821cb3026a.avif?t=1665541470\" /></div><br><br>For more good, most of things in Wall breaking world is can be elimited, and each time you do elimination, you will get Tetris's pow, it is some kind of magic pow, that will help you to make some powful spell.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7bf26e1c28dcd88a65b341cacd7f0389.poster.avif?t=1665541470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7bf26e1c28dcd88a65b341cacd7f0389.webm?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7bf26e1c28dcd88a65b341cacd7f0389.mp4?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Open world</h2>In Wall Breaking world, you will never see level pick panel. Each time you break the wall of current Tetris room, you can chose next target by your owner mind, <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7f927e179dcd20e09661c58e345099f8.poster.avif?t=1665541470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7f927e179dcd20e09661c58e345099f8.webm?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/7f927e179dcd20e09661c58e345099f8.mp4?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And the final target is try to find the way out of the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/b162a958175c0d103d4b3d6db6694097.avif?t=1665541470\" /></div><br><br>You will love the journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Spell</h2>As you got the powfull energy: Tetris pow, ofcause you will learn kinds of spells.<br>The ice spell: Pow of Ice<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/95d98e86704b2cc24c2879c124b31b49.poster.avif?t=1665541470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/95d98e86704b2cc24c2879c124b31b49.webm?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/95d98e86704b2cc24c2879c124b31b49.mp4?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Electric spell: Pow of Electric<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/eeb550c7bad8f30bda6258fcbf2f354c.poster.avif?t=1665541470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/eeb550c7bad8f30bda6258fcbf2f354c.webm?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055620/extras/eeb550c7bad8f30bda6258fcbf2f354c.mp4?t=1665541470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>what was the next? You will find it by youself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Huge Puzzle</h2>Except the Tetris room, we created some huge puzzle for you.<br>In Huge Puzzle, you need face more Complex game mechanics. <br>For example, Double Tetris Room, you need eliminate the cube at tow synchronization room.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Final fight</h2>of cause you will need to fight ,use your sword or your spell.<br>beat the final monster or find the way to avoid the fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Open world + Tetris =?, Are you find the answer? Yeah, add WISH LIST at now!</h2>",
